# CAREGUARDIAN AI — FULL WORKING APPLICATION BUILD PROMPT

Build a complete, runnable full-stack application called **CareGuardian AI — AI Elderly Care, Medication Monitoring & Voice Companion**.

This is a working prototype/MVP, not a static UI mockup.

The application must run locally and demonstrate the complete patient → AI → medication → caregiver workflow.

---

## 1. PRODUCT VISION

CareGuardian AI is an elderly-care assistant designed for families where an elderly person may need regular medication reminders, daily health check-ins, voice interaction, and caregiver monitoring.

The elderly user should not need to repeatedly open complicated menus.

At medication time, the application should actively notify the patient and open/show the medication assistant when technically possible.

The AI should address the patient by their preferred name.

Example:

**"Namaste Ravi ji, aapki dawai lene ka time ho gaya hai. Kya aapne dawai le li?"**

The patient can answer naturally:

**"Haan beta, maine le li."**

The system understands the response, records it, updates the medication event, and notifies the caregiver.

The patient can also voluntarily start a conversation:

**"Mujhe CareGuardian se baat karni hai."**

The AI should then have a natural Hindi/Hinglish voice conversation.

