# 13. AI STRUCTURED RESPONSE

The LLM should return structured JSON.

Example:

```json
{
  "intent": "MEDICATION_TAKEN",
  "status": "TAKEN",
  "confidence": 0.96,
  "requires_clarification": false
}
```

The backend validates this response.

The LLM must NEVER directly update the database.

The backend decides whether the requested action is allowed.

If confidence is low:

```text
"Ravi ji, mujhe thoda clearly nahi samajh aaya.
Kya aapne dawai le li hai?"
```

